OL,3,AFirst female prime minister named in
OL,4,AMorocco after winning elections
OL,5,
OL,6,FFatima Zahra El Mansouri has been named
OL,7,FMorocco's first female prime minister,
OL,8,Fafter her centrist Authenticity and
OL,9,FModernity Party (Pam) won the most
OL,10,Fseats in last week's parliamentary
OL,11,Felections.
OL,13,FHer appointment makes her only the
OL,14,Fsecond woman to lead a government in
OL,15,Fthe Arab world, after Tunisia's Najla
OL,16,FBouden.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
