OL,3,AFirst female prime minister named in
OL,4,AMorocco after winning elections
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe was named by King Mohammed VI, who
OL,7,Fchose her as prime minister over the
OL,8,Fcountry's football chief Fouzi Lekjaa,
OL,9,Fa top politician from the same party.
OL,10,FEl Mansouri, 50, has been the mayor of
OL,11,FMarrakesh for a number of years and
OL,12,Falso served as a minister in the
OL,13,Fprevious coalition government.
OL,15,FMorocco is a constitutional monarchy
OL,16,Fbut most power remains in the hands of
OL,17,Fthe king.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
